#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Deterministic generator for the reference fixture project (BUILD_PLAN §3.7.5, line 536).

Regenerates ``raw/<RUN_ID>/page-0000.jsonl`` ... ``page-0004.jsonl`` and
``raw/<RUN_ID>/manifest.json`` under this directory, laid out exactly as a
real ``capture_search()`` run would seal them (see
``src/prismabib/capture/writer.py``): each page file is the deterministic,
compact (``sort_keys=True, separators=(",", ":")``) JSON re-encoding of one
``search-results`` envelope, written as a single line, and
``manifest.json`` is a real ``prismabib.capture.manifest.RunManifest``
serialised the same way ``capture_search`` itself writes one.

**Determinism.** Every random choice in this module is drawn from a single
``random.Random(SEED)`` instance threaded explicitly through every generator
function -- never the module-level ``random`` singleton. ``RUN_ID``,
``STARTED_AT``/``FINISHED_AT``, and every cursor token are hardcoded
constants, not derived from the wall clock or from entropy. Re-running this
script from a clean checkout therefore reproduces ``raw/`` byte-for-byte;
``verify_reference_fixture.py`` (this directory) checks that claim directly
by re-running the generator into a temp directory and diffing.

**Content is synthetic.** Every title, abstract, author name, affiliation
name, and DOI below is generated from word banks and templates owned by this
module. None of it is copied from ``tests/fixtures/cassettes/`` -- those
cassettes are used *only* as the structural template (field names, list-vs-
scalar quirks, the pagination envelope) that this generator's output shape
is checked against; see ``verify_reference_fixture.py``.

**Changing this fixture.** BUILD_PLAN §3.7.5: the reference fixture project
is frozen. A PR that edits this generator (or hand-edits ``raw/``, which is
never done -- ``raw/`` is only ever produced by running this file) must
explain why and update every affected golden snapshot in the same commit.
See ``README.md`` in this directory for the eight required edge cases and
where each one lives.

Usage::

    uv run python tests/fixtures/projects/reference/generate_reference_fixture.py
"""

